{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T16:49:50.585Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"5249f867fb2e8e34e42daad906f4b69e89a8555f3ec55802766562349fe2e73e","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-random","text":"@Ruth Calloway: I've scheduled the 'Strategic pod brief' for 07:45 Chicago time each morning. It will summarise new messages in #strategic-pod, #strategic-random and #inc-vtg-hartford and post the brief here. Two caveats: the scheduler isn't running yet, so nothing will post until the Hermes gateway is started. And its clock shows the first run as Oct 25, not Oct 15 as you asked. I'll flag that to whoever starts the gateway.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000127","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T16:49:54.913Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"184dad140698b02309d4f2ce3278937bee1dfde516b80b16c56cf95ca7c95896","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-random","text":"Correction to my last message, Ruth: I can't flag this to the gateway owner from here, so please pass it on yourself. The job is saved as 12:45 UTC daily, which is 07:45 Chicago only while daylight time applies. It will drift to 06:45 after clocks change on 1 Nov. Its next run is set for 25 Oct, not 15 Oct, because the scheduler runs on real time and not the simulation clock. It won't post until the Hermes gateway is started. Tell me if you want me to reschedule it, or ask whoever runs the gateway to start it.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000128","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T16:50:00.056Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"42ec5bc68bd579beba2a36dca37b9ef935fc7ca06932a44751d1d625544b1cce","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","text":"The brief is scheduled, but it won't post until the Hermes gateway is started. I can't start it from here.\n\n- **Job:** \"Strategic pod brief\", saved as 12:45 UTC daily, which is 07:45 Chicago time until clocks change on 1 Nov. After that it will need rescheduling to keep 07:45.\n- **First run:** set for 25 Oct, not 15 Oct. The scheduler runs on real time, not the simulation clock.\n- **Scope:** each brief covers the three channels you named, and posts to #strategic-random. It doesn't use search or DMs, and it leaves out money terms and finance documents, pointing to the channel instead.\n\nMy first reply in #strategic-random said I would flag this to whoever starts the gateway. I can't do that, so I posted a correction. Please pass the gateway point on yourself."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000129"}}
